<title>USA: Applied Cellular says finalizes ATI deal.</title>
<headline>Applied Cellular says finalizes ATI deal.</headline>
<dateline>NIXA, Mo. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Cellular Technology Inc said it finalized its acquisition agreement with ATI Communications of Bethel Park, Pa., and will complete the acquisition on or before October 7.</p>
<p>Privately held ATI is a large independent retailer and supplier of interconnection and cellular phone equipment.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Applied Cellular is a computer technology company specializing in wireless cellular technologies.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
